WEBVTT

00:00:25.704 --> 00:00:30.621
čini se krajnje složena,
zbrkana i zbrčkana.

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:32.746
Mnogo je vrsta zbrkanosti.

00:00:33.412 --> 00:00:36.996
Zapravo, pukim slučajem,

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:39.746
pred mnogo godina, bio sam uključen

00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:42.204
u studiju tog oblika kompleksnosti,

00:00:42.537 --> 00:00:45.037
i na moje veliko iznenađenje,

00:00:45.371 --> 00:00:47.121
našao sam tragove --

00:00:47.204 --> 00:00:49.079
vrlo jasne tragove, moram reći --

00:00:49.162 --> 00:00:51.371
reda u toj hrapavosti.

00:00:52.037 --> 00:00:54.162
Tako vam danas želim dati

00:00:54.412 --> 00:00:57.704
nekoliko primjera onog što to predstavlja.

00:00:58.329 --> 00:01:00.079
Draža mi je riječ hrapavost